{#- Keyboards and callback popups; YAML after rendering (profile/config values only, no user input).
    Context: profile, channel, channel_url, contact, contact_url.
    funnel: buttons under the offer message, callback_data tier_<id>, in this order;
    Entry keys: id; button (default: tier cta, else title); reply_button; reply_url (default: tier url,
    else the contact); lead (default true: alert the admin about a commercial lead). Profile texts are
    taken by the code from the tier, not pasted here, so quotes in them cannot break the YAML.
    The diy tier is what the user has just received, so it gets no button. -#}
subscribe: "📢 Подписаться на канал {{ channel }}"
check_sub: "✅ Проверить подписку и получить материал"
sub_confirmed: "✅ Подписка подтверждена!"
not_subscribed: "Подписка на канал {{ channel }} пока не найдена.\n\nПодпишитесь и нажмите кнопку ещё раз — материал придёт сразу."
funnel:
{%- for tier in profile.offer_tiers if tier.id != "diy" %}
  - id: {{ tier.id }}
    reply_button: "{{ "👉 Подробнее" if tier.url else "💬 Написать" }}"
{%- else %} []
{%- endfor %}
